# Keeps the Docker build context (sent to the daemon before `turbo prune`
# even runs) small and free of stale local artifacts that shouldn't leak
# into the image.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
.expo
**/.expo
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.log

.git
.github

.env
.env.*
!.env.*.example

timely-capsule-api
timelycapsule
timelycapsule-mobile

# Note: apps/web and apps/mobile are deliberately NOT excluded here even
# though @tc/api's Dockerfile doesn't need their code — `turbo prune`
# resolves the full workspace graph from pnpm-workspace.yaml and needs every
# workspace package's directory to actually exist to do that; it discards
# what @tc/api doesn't depend on itself once pruning completes.
